  "feedbacks": [],
  "notes": [
    "The module has no feedbacks: it only sends UDP text commands (for example '<pb>,<value>L') to the console's UDP port; no reply is read.",
    "Option values are resolved with parseVariablesInString in every callback, but the text inputs do not set useVariables in the source, so the field flag is not recorded.",
    "Numbers are text inputs with regex Regex.NUMBER (resolved constant, informational). The ranges in the labels (playback 1-202, intensity channel 1-32769) are label text only and not enforced by the module.",
    "The module is separate from chamsys-magicq-osc (OSC), has no presets or variables catalogued, and is CommonJS on @companion-module/base ~1.4.3 (no expressions).",
    "ChamSys QuickQ has its own module (chamsys-quickq) and is not covered here."
  ]
